    "isDuplicateOf": null,
    "content": "Traditional treasury models are being challenged as the financial industry transitions toward continuous, 24/7 payment processing. Citi has successfully executed live U.S. dollar transactions using Swift’s blockchain-based ledger in collaboration with First Abu Dhabi Bank and OCBC. This development highlights a broader shift away from reliance on conventional banking cutoffs, requiring organizations to modernize their operating frameworks to support real-time, cross-border financial activity that persists throughout the weekend.",
